          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lola, mu ndaalo echo ne mu siise esio nga ndikobosia kimiaandu kia Yuda ne Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibuusia chikholo choosi ne khuchireera mu Litooma lie bukhalaki lia Yehoshafati. Ne ndichikhalakila ebweeneyo khulwe babaandu base ne kumukabwa kwase Isiraeli, sikila babasalanisia mu bibala bikeni ne khukabaniamo sibala siabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi bapile chikura khulwe babaandu base mala baanile omwana omusoleeli khulwe khuruunga bueeyi, ne khuaana omwana omukhaana khulwe khuruunga ndali, mala bakinywele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
