            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areeba ali, “Ee Tiro ne Sidoni ne bibala bioosi bia Filisiti enywe muli siina khwise? Enywe mulikho munduunga khulwa siindu siina? Mwaba ne mulikho munduunga, ndamwiyacha khulwe bikholwa bienywe khangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila mwabukuule efwesa yase ne esahabu ne khusuta kamabiikhilo kase ke buiinda ne khuyila mu ngaangu chenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakusiisie babaandu base ba Yuda nende be mu lukoba lwa Yerusalemu khu baandu ba Kiriki. Ne khubayila aleeyi khukhwama mu sibala siabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali luno ndabaachilisia khukhwama niio mwabakusia, mala kheache khwinywe khu niko mwabakholela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakusia babaana benywe basoleeli ne bakhaana khu baandu ba Yuda mala babaandu ba Yuda balabakusia khu baandu ba Sabea, babaandu be aleeyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wele alaana chikhabi khu baandu bewe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
